  "scene_id": "zhu_yao_witness_boundary",
  "title": "证据不能比证人更先被保住",
  "entry_node": "zy_line_01",
  "participants": ["protagonist", "zhu_yao"],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "zy_line_01",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker_id": "zhu_yao",
      "expression": "firm",
      "outfit": "wasteland_witness",
      "text": "纸烧了可以追副本，人若被你们为了证据再推过一次红线，就没有副本能替她回来。我的决定只能管我这一份，另外两个人要不要留下、要不要撤签，得由她们自己说。",
      "next": "zy_choice_01"
    },
    {
      "id": "zy_choice_01",
      "type": "choice",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "zy_choice_person_first",
          "text": "把证物副本分散保管，冻结亲属栏；每名当事人分别选择继续、撤签、匿名避险或暂不决定，试验越线就暂停。",
          "next": "zy_line_02",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "relation_delta", "character_id": "zhu_yao", "stat": "trust", "delta": 2},
            {"type": "set_flag", "flag": "zhu_yao_person_first_recorded", "value": true}
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "zy_choice_evidence_first",
          "text": "先把三十七份不明席槽全部归入案件证据并完成统一撤签，个人是否同意留到副本整理后再问。",
          "next": "zy_line_02",
          "effects": [
            {"type": "relation_delta", "character_id": "zhu_yao", "stat": "respect", "delta": 1},
            {"type": "set_flag", "flag": "zhu_yao_evidence_first_requested", "value": true}
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "zy_line_02",
      "type": "line",
      "speaker_id": "protagonist",
      "expression": "focused",
      "outfit": "default",
      "text": "你把证物来源、本人选择、亲属关系、设备供能和撤回时刻分栏。祝遥保住了能够追责的副本，也保留了一个空白结论：找不到本人，不等于替本人同意继续。",
      "next": "zy_effect_01"
    },
